    <briefdescription>
<para>Orchestrator that owns a block matrix, RHS, and solution vectors. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Ties together <ref refid="classNeoN_1_1la_1_1BlockMatrix" kindref="compound">BlockMatrix</ref>, <ref refid="classNeoN_1_1la_1_1BlockVector" kindref="compound">BlockVector</ref>, and BlockSolve with expression-driven assembly using bdsl operators. Operators carry field names; <ref refid="classNeoN_1_1la_1_1BlockLinearSystem" kindref="compound">BlockLinearSystem</ref> maps names to block columns during assembly. </para>
